        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-TEDDY_BEAR-PAGETURNER-BRIDGE-STRATEGY.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-PAGETURNER-BRIDGE-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-QUALIFIED    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-RENDERMAN-ENGINE-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-CARDIAC-PULSE-BOUND-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-FRAMEBUFFER-RASTER-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-BRIDGE-WITNESS           PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-TEDDY_BEAR-BRIDGE.
            GOBACK.
        1000-VERIFY-TEDDY_BEAR-BRIDGE.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TEDDY_BEAR-HEART-QUALIFIED = 1 AND
               WS-RENDERMAN-ENGINE-OK = 1 AND
               WS-CARDIAC-PULSE-BOUND-OK = 1 AND
               WS-FRAMEBUFFER-RASTER-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-BRIDGE-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-BRIDGE-WITNESS.
